    "description": "This hilarious and touching documentary tells the story of how three older, gay, \"bears\" working in Hollywood, tired of having their gay-themed ideas rejected by the mainstream, decided to self-produce their own web series. Against all odds, the comedy featuring three bear roommates like \"The Golden Girls\" solving crimes a la \"Murder, She Wrote,\" became a sensation online and one of the most successful web shows of all time. The documentary examines ageism, body-shaming, sex-positivity, the creative process and how friendship and community can ultimately create something beloved all over the world.",
